        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86424, Alexander Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Alexander Cabinet Pull is a transitional cabinet pull great for updating classic homes. The Alexander Pull  manages to straddle the modern and traditional decor worlds. The Emtek Alexander Transitional Cabinet Door Pull is available in many sizes and finish color options. Each comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/alexander-refrigerator-handle-emtek-ap-86442\"><b>Alexander Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Alexander Transitional Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86424-specifications.pdf?v=1704262429\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Alexander Cabinet Pull Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86424:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86425:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86484:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86426:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86427:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86485:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86479:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
